  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f36e4a3bd6572705",
      "translationZh": "Coval 有一个公开的 TTS 排行榜，上面列了 25 个 API。测试框架是开源的，所以我们就用它测试了我们位于 https://www.nineninesix.ai 的 API，结果如下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24f3e0aa985516ae",
      "translationZh": "首段音频延迟为 68.7 ms（p50）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73ec84f02cc72024",
      "translationZh": "p90 为 85.8 ms，最慢的样本为 104.8 ms",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6e8a4f80ae2d293",
      "translationZh": "开始说话前有 20.5 ms 的静音",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcd7aa3b0ec6f048",
      "translationZh": "TTFA 低于他们榜单上公布的所有数值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db58b751bd64c1f1",
      "translationZh": "我们自己从加利福尼亚发起测试，测试的是我们自己的端点，并扣除了网络往返延迟。Coval 自己的各行结果没有做这种归一化处理，因此包含了其测试运行器所用网络路径带来的延迟。我们更希望由 Coval 自己来运行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0516102dc24a134b",
      "translationZh": "这个结果来自 Runpod 上的一张 RTX 4090，而不是一整机架的设备。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f97d459306a16f3a",
      "translationZh": "我们的模型采用 Apache 2.0 许可，所以你也可以去做同样的事。榜单上的 25 个 API 中，有 24 个是闭源的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d25291eceecda816",
      "translationZh": "如果你想试试看，可以克隆 https://github.com/nineninesix-ai/benchmarks 。（你可以使用 vllm 对自己的模型进行基准测试）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d5e9c89f210e8af",
      "translationZh": "图表、完整方法以及其余注意事项：https://www.nineninesix.ai/blog/gepard-coval-tts-leaderboard",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
